-- Expands the curated bank 5x: +280 questions per (level, category) bucket,
-- from 70 to 350 - 3,150 questions in total (up from 630). Math is still
-- generated, not stored.
--
-- Same standard as migrations 004 and 010: every answer was worked through,
-- none of the new question_text or riddle answers duplicates anything that
-- already existed or anything else in this batch (checked by script: exact
-- and near-duplicate text, riddle-answer collisions per level), and answer
-- positions are balanced across the four slots. On top of that, every one of
-- the 2,520 questions was then solved BLIND by an independent pass that never
-- saw the answer key, and each disagreement or ambiguity flag was reviewed by
-- hand; the 13 questions that turned out ambiguous or badly worded were rewritten
-- or replaced before this file was generated. No concept tags yet (column stays
-- null) - see docs/blueprint.md.

