(1, 'logic', 'Which number does not fit the pattern: 8, 16, 24, 30, 40?', '["30", "16", "24", "40"]', 0, 'The numbers count by 8s: 8, 16, 24, 32, 40. So 30 does not fit.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Which number does not fit the pattern: 100, 90, 80, 75, 60?', '["90", "75", "80", "60"]', 1, 'The numbers go down by 10s: 100, 90, 80, 70, 60. So 75 does not fit.'),
