(1, 'logic', 'What comes next in the pattern: 2, 3, 4, 2, 3, 4, 2, ___?', '["3", "2", "4", "5"]', 0, 'The group 2, 3, 4 repeats. After the 2 comes 3.'),
(1, 'logic', 'The lights blink: On, Off, On, Off, On. What comes next?', '["On", "Dim", "Off", "Flash"]', 2, 'The lights take turns being on and off, so after On comes Off.'),
