(1, 'logic', 'What letter comes next: Z, Y, X, W, ___?', '["U", "A", "V", "T"]', 2, 'The letters go backward through the alphabet, and V comes just before W.'),
(1, 'logic', 'A dance goes: Clap, Clap, Stomp, Clap, Clap, Stomp, Clap. What comes next?', '["Stomp", "Jump", "Clap", "Spin"]', 2, 'The dance repeats clap, clap, stomp. After one clap comes another clap.'),
(1, 'logic', 'What comes next: Small, Medium, Large, Small, Medium, ___?', '["Large", "Small", "Medium", "Huge"]', 0, 'The sizes repeat small, medium, large. After medium comes large.'),
