(1, 'logic', 'What letter comes next: B, D, F, H, ___?', '["I", "J", "K", "G"]', 1, 'The letters skip one each time: B, D, F, H, J.'),
(1, 'logic', 'What comes next: A, B, A, B, A, ___?', '["A", "B", "C", "D"]', 1, 'The letters take turns, A then B, so after A comes B.'),
