(1, 'logic', 'A pattern of dots grows like this: 1 dot, 2 dots, 3 dots, 4 dots. How many dots come next?', '["5", "4", "6", "8"]', 0, 'One more dot is added each time, so after 4 dots come 5 dots.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Which letter is missing: M, N, ___, P, Q?', '["L", "R", "O", "K"]', 2, 'The letters go in alphabet order: M, N, O, P, Q.'),
