(1, 'logic', 'A farm has 2 cows and 3 chickens. How many legs do they have altogether?', '["10", "12", "16", "14"]', 3, 'Cows have 4 legs each: 8. Chickens have 2 legs each: 6. And 8 + 6 = 14.'),
(1, 'logic', 'How many letters are in the word BANANA?', '["5", "6", "7", "3"]', 1, 'B-A-N-A-N-A has six letters.'),
