(1, 'logic', 'A ribbon is 10 cm long and Pia cuts it into 2 equal pieces. How long is each piece?', '["4 cm", "5 cm", "2 cm", "8 cm"]', 1, '10 divided into 2 equal pieces is 5 cm each.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Four friends share 12 grapes equally. How many grapes does each friend get?', '["2", "4", "3", "8"]', 2, '12 divided by 4 is 3, since 3 + 3 + 3 + 3 = 12.'),
