(1, 'logic', 'Which is greater: 4 + 5 or 3 + 7?', '["4 + 5", "They are equal", "Cannot tell", "3 + 7"]', 3, '4 + 5 = 9 and 3 + 7 = 10, and 10 is greater than 9.'),
(1, 'logic', 'A pencil costs 2 coins. Pia has 9 coins. How many pencils can she buy?', '["4", "3", "5", "7"]', 0, '4 pencils cost 8 coins. A fifth would cost 10, which is too much.'),
(1, 'logic', 'In the park, 6 kids are on swings, 4 are on the slide and 3 are in the sandbox. How many kids are there in all?', '["13", "10", "12", "14"]', 0, '6 + 4 = 10, then 10 + 3 = 13.'),
