(1, 'logic', 'Lena and Ravi each have one pet: a cat or a dog. Lena has the cat. Who has the dog?', '["Lena", "Both of them", "Ravi", "Neither of them"]', 2, 'There are only two pets. Lena has the cat, so the dog belongs to Ravi.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Amy, Ben and Cy each have a cup: red, blue or green. Amy has red and Ben has blue. Which cup does Cy have?', '["Red", "Green", "Blue", "Yellow"]', 1, 'Red and blue are taken, so Cy must have the green cup.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Ola, Pim and Ken each eat a different fruit: an apple, a pear or a plum. Ola eats the apple. Pim does not eat the pear. What does Pim eat?', '["An apple", "A pear", "A grape", "A plum"]', 3, 'Ola has the apple. Pim does not have the pear, so Pim has the plum.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Sofia, Wei and Idris wear a red, a yellow and a black hat. Sofia''s hat is not red or yellow. What color is Sofia''s hat?', '["Black", "Red", "Yellow", "Green"]', 0, 'Sofia cannot have red or yellow, so her hat is black.'),
(1, 'logic', 'One box holds toys and the other holds books. Box A does not hold toys. What is in Box A?', '["Toys", "Books", "Both", "Nothing"]', 1, 'Box A has no toys, and the only other choice is books.'),
(1, 'logic', 'A key is hidden in one of three boxes: red, blue or green. It is not in the red box and not in the blue box. Where is the key?', '["In the red box", "In the blue box", "In no box", "In the green box"]', 3, 'Two boxes are ruled out, so the key must be in the green box.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Ari is Tia''s brother. Tia is Mo''s sister. What is Ari to Mo?', '["Father", "Cousin", "Brother", "Uncle"]', 2, 'Ari and Tia are siblings, and Tia and Mo are siblings, so Ari is Mo''s brother.'),
