(1, 'logic', 'Ivy is 9 years old and Jon is 6 years old. Which one is older?', '["Jon", "Ivy", "They are twins", "Cannot tell"]', 1, '9 is more than 6, so Ivy is older.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Ari, Bo, Cai and Dee each have a different pet: a fish, a cat, a dog or a bird. Ari has the fish, Cai has the cat and Bo does not have the dog. What pet does Bo have?', '["The bird", "The fish", "The cat", "The dog"]', 0, 'Fish and cat are taken. Bo and Dee are left with dog and bird. Bo cannot have the dog, so Bo has the bird.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Nina stands next to Omar, and Omar stands next to Pia. Nina is not next to Pia. Who is in the middle of the three?', '["Nina", "Pia", "Cannot tell", "Omar"]', 3, 'Omar is next to both, and Nina and Pia are not next to each other, so Omar is in the middle.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Ken is 8 years old. Lu is 2 years older than Ken. Mo is 1 year younger than Ken. Who is the oldest?', '["Ken", "Mo", "They are the same age", "Lu"]', 3, 'Lu is 10, Ken is 8 and Mo is 7, so Lu is the oldest.'),
(1, 'logic', 'A zoo has a lion, a monkey and a parrot in cages 1, 2 and 3. The lion is in cage 1 and the monkey is not in cage 2. Which cage has the parrot?', '["Cage 2", "Cage 1", "Cage 3", "Cage 4"]', 0, 'The lion has cage 1. The monkey is not in cage 2, so it is in cage 3, and the parrot is in cage 2.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Rue, Sam and Tia are a baker, a pilot and a farmer. Rue is the farmer. Sam is not the pilot. Who is the pilot?', '["Rue", "Sam", "Tia", "Cannot tell"]', 2, 'Rue is the farmer. Sam is not the pilot, so Sam is the baker and Tia is the pilot.'),
(1, 'logic', 'A snack box holds one cookie and one apple. Mo does not want the cookie. What does he take?', '["The cookie", "The apple", "Both", "Neither"]', 1, 'With only two snacks and no cookie for Mo, he takes the apple.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Aiko, Ben and Cara each hold one balloon: a round one, a long one and a heart one. Aiko''s balloon is not round and not long. Which balloon does Aiko hold?', '["The round balloon", "The long balloon", "Cannot tell", "The heart balloon"]', 3, 'Round and long are ruled out, so Aiko has the heart balloon.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Jade is 7 years old and has a twin. How old is her twin?', '["6", "7", "8", "14"]', 1, 'Twins are born on the same day, so they are the same age.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Which statement about temperature is true?', '["Ice is cold", "Fire is cold", "Snow is hot", "Soup is always frozen"]', 0, 'Ice is frozen water, and it feels cold.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Which of these facts is FALSE?', '["A week has 7 days", "A hand has 5 fingers", "A cat has 6 legs", "A square has 4 sides"]', 2, 'Cats have 4 legs, not 6.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Which statement about numbers is true?', '["2 + 2 = 5", "5 is bigger than 3", "10 is smaller than 4", "7 is an even number"]', 1, '5 is more than 3. The other statements are wrong.'),
