(1, 'logic', 'Which of these things can NEVER be true?', '["A bird that cannot fly", "A fish that can swim", "A number that is both odd and even", "A cold day in winter"]', 2, 'A whole number is either odd or even, never both. Penguins are birds that cannot fly.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Dan says, "All the balls in this bag are red." You pull out a blue ball from the bag. Is Dan right?', '["Yes", "No", "Yes, if it is small", "Cannot tell"]', 1, 'A blue ball in the bag shows that not all the balls are red.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Which is more: 5 or 3 + 3?', '["5", "They are equal", "3 + 3", "Cannot tell"]', 2, '3 + 3 = 6, and 6 is more than 5.'),
