(1, 'logic', 'A red rope is 9 cm long and a blue rope is 14 cm long. How much longer is the blue rope?', '["4 cm", "5 cm", "6 cm", "23 cm"]', 1, 'The blue rope is 14 cm and the red is 9 cm, so 14 - 9 = 5 cm.'),
(1, 'logic', 'Which weighs more: 1 kilogram of feathers or 1 kilogram of rocks?', '["They weigh the same", "The feathers", "The rocks", "Cannot tell"]', 0, 'Both are 1 kilogram, so they weigh exactly the same.'),
